The LCD controller (LCDC) on the RZ/V2H(P) SoC is composed of Frame
Compression Processor (FCPVD), Video Signal Processor (VSPD), and
Display Unit (DU).

There is one LCDC unit available on the RZ/V2H(P) SoC which is connected
to the DSI.

